{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生の目黒陽色（めぐろひいろ）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏もいよいよ折り返し☀️\n毎日暑いですが、みなさん元気に過ごしていますか❔"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏らしい写真かな🍧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobCiKz4D.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わこが撮ってくれたよー！\n一緒に桃のパフェ食べにいった時の。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わこはいろんな分野に詳しくて、どんな話でも広げてくれるから話してて楽しいし、落ち着くんだ〜😚☕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなもみずみずしい食べ物を頬張って、ちょっぴり涼しく過ごしてね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「Sakurazaka46 ARENA TOUR 2026 -What's lonesome?-」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めてアリーナツアーに参加させていただいています！🔥"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡、神戸、広島、千葉公演\n来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobWwb8NN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobtK3FC9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobWYTlBD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobsDoQBh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob66g5Pj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobqIVRt6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ライブでみんなに会うたびに、たくさんのパワーをもらって、その日の景色や言葉がまた次の日から頑張るための糧になっています❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「また会える日」をご褒美に、そこまで頑張ろうって思える。\nそうやってみんなと過ごした時間が、また私の背中を押してくれているんだなって思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "残りの仙台、香川の4公演も楽しみにしてるね❕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね〜❕"}], "source": "official"}